@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 注册功能时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/注册页\n(Login.vue: 注册模式)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "后端控制器\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
database "UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI: 输入用户名/邮箱/密码/确认密码
UI -> Axios: POST /api/auth/register\n{ username,email,password,confirmPassword }
Axios -> AuthCtrl: POST /auth/register
AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: register(dto)
UserSvc -> DB: 用户名/邮箱唯一性检查
alt 已存在
  UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 抛出 “用户名已存在/邮箱已被使用”
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end
UserSvc -> UserSvc: password encode / 初始化字段
UserSvc -> DB: 保存用户(USER 角色)
UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 注册成功
AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message: 注册成功 }
Axios --> UI: 显示成功，切换至登录

note over AuthCtrl
接口：POST /api/auth/register
end note

@enduml

